  "module_rules": [
    "Module keys follow 14 §4.0.1. core_maintenance is always on.",
    "A tenant module that is off hides its screens and navigation (21 §5.2); it is not greyed out.",
    "snow_ice on means Snow Lite (14 §4.3.0, every plan, no charge). The full Snow & Ice module is the snow_ice add-on (plans.json).",
